      "content": "i know there are people who care but it doesnt feel real. it feels like i'm just stuck in a loop of being miserable and everyone else is just pretending it's fine to be nice to me. part of me thinks maybe it's more compassionate to just stop fighting it. like, why keep putting everyone through this if the outcome is always gonna be the same?",
